{"name": "Ortensia Shanghai", "name_en": "Ortensia", "district": "静安区", "address": "上海市静安区茂名北路240号张园W14栋(19世纪石库门老宅)", "price_avg": 1688, "price_range": "品鉴套餐1288/1688/2288元三档(+10%服务费)；包厢最低消费午餐4000/晚餐8000", "cuisine_paths": [["西餐", "法餐"], ["中餐", "融合菜"]], "form": "私宴会所", "signature_dishes": ["龙井绿茶烟熏乳鸽", "鱼子酱牛肉塔塔", "时令鱼花胶豌豆蛤蜊清汤", "Ikejime鰤鱼昆布佛手柑"], "phone_raw": null, "booking_method": "官网预约(restaurantortensia.com)，每月15号开放下月预订，晚餐订金1000/位，午餐订金300/位，提前1-2周", "status": "open", "awards": {"michelin": "无", "black_pearl": 0, "source_url": null}, "price_sources": [{"platform": "Rolling Grace/官网", "value": 1688, "url": "https://rollinggrace.com/2026/07/15/ortensia-shanghai/"}], "evidence": {"diner_quotes": [{"quote": "The Longjing Green Tea Smoked Pigeon is the dish that explains the whole project. The breast smoked low and slow under Longjing green tea, the skin crackles delicately, the smoke lingers on the palate for a full minute after the bite is gone. The signature beef tartare with caviar uses Shandong Snow Dragon beef, deliberately tasting like Paris.", "source": "Rolling Grace", "url": "https://rollinggrace.com/2026/07/15/ortensia-shanghai/", "date": "2026-07-15"}, {"quote": "The seasonal fish course: fish maw slow-braised brings luxurious gelatinous body, finished tableside with clear clam bouillon deeply savoury with natural sweetness. The Ikejime sea bream cured in Japanese kombu, bergamot lifts everything with bright aromatic edge almost Earl Grey-like.", "source": "Rolling Grace", "url": "https://rollinggrace.com/2026/07/15/ortensia-shanghai/", "date": "2026-07-15"}], "platform_scores": [{"platform": "官网/预订制", "score": null, "review_count": null, "url": "https://www.restaurantortensia.com/shanghai"}], "negative_signals": ["不接受素食/无麸质/无乳糖特殊饮食，48小时前告知", "品鉴套餐固定不可调", " hosted tasting(媒体品鉴)非自费"], "soft_ad_flags": ["Rolling Grace文末注明based on hosted tasting"], "traffic_signals": ["每月15号开放下月预订秒光", "巴黎一星二店", "包厢最低消费8000晚餐"]}, "sources": [{"title": "Rolling Grace-Ortensia Shanghai 6 Stunning Dishes", "url": "https://rollinggrace.com/2026/07/15/ortensia-shanghai/", "type": "media"}, {"title": "Ortensia官网-预订规则", "url": "https://www.restaurantortensia.com/shanghai", "type": "brand_official"}], "scores": {"objective": 75, "diner": 80, "taste": 85, "endorsement": 82, "soft_ad_penalty": 5, "platform_credibility": 0.85}, "data_updated_at": "2026-09-24", "notes": "巴黎一星Ortensia二店，2024年10月开业，张园石库门。行政主厨Terumitsu Saito(日籍驻巴黎)，上海主厨Hana Zhou。sources仅2类(media+brand)，缺UGC堂食原话，待补。"}
{"name": "Endo", "name_en": "Endo", "district": "徐汇区", "address": "上海市徐汇区武夷路320弄Wuyi MIX320街区", "price_avg": 500, "price_range": "甜点品鉴套餐(配茶/酒)", "cuisine_paths": [["西餐", "甜品"]], "form": "私宴会所", "signature_dishes": ["桃子芬诺雪葩配核桃奶酪无花果叶提取物", "米酒曲饮料配紫苏"], "phone_raw": "15221274511", "booking_method": "电话预约15221274511，至少提前3天", "status": "open", "awards": {"michelin": "无", "black_pearl": 0, "source_url": null}, "price_sources": [{"platform": "TimeOut EN", "value": 500, "url": "http://www.timeoutshanghai.com/features/Feature/105570/8-Eateries-in-Shanghai-Where-Reservations-Are-Rather-Necessary.html"}], "evidence": {"diner_quotes": [{"quote": "Endo, Shanghai's first dessert degustation specialist, is a refined, reservations-only restaurant that pairs plated desserts with tea and/or wine. The final traces of summer encapsulated in fuzzy peaches perfumed with fennel, walnut cheese, and fig leaf extract. The fermented rice and koji drink pairing was given a soft pink blush using perilla.", "source": "TimeOut Shanghai EN", "url": "http://www.timeoutshanghai.com/features/Feature/105570/8-Eateries-in-Shanghai-Where-Reservations-Are-Rather-Necessary.html", "date": "2025-03-26"}], "platform_scores": [{"platform": "TimeOut(推荐)", "score": null, "review_count": null, "url": "http://www.timeoutshanghai.com/features/Feature/105570/8-Eateries-in-Shanghai-Where-Reservations-Are-Rather-Necessary.html"}], "negative_signals": ["仅TimeOut一篇，缺UGC", "甜点头盘非正餐私宴"], "soft_ad_flags": [], "traffic_signals": ["需提前3天预约", "上海首家甜点品鉴专门店"]}, "sources": [{"title": "TimeOut EN-Endo dessert degustation", "url": "http://www.timeoutshanghai.com/features/Feature/105570/8-Eateries-in-Shanghai-Where-Reservations-Are-Rather-Necessary.html", "type": "media"}], "scores": {"objective": 55, "diner": 60, "taste": 75, "endorsement": 60, "soft_ad_penalty": 0, "platform_credibility": 0.7}, "data_updated_at": "2026-09-24", "notes": "存疑：sources仅TimeOut一篇。上海首家甜点degustation，预约制。需真人补UGC。"}
